.\" Man page for hive-apt
.TH HIVE-APT 1 "January 2025" "DruidOS 0.1.0" "DruidOS Hive Stack"

.SH NAME
hive-apt \- intelligent apt wrapper with AI assistance and ZFS integration

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hive-apt
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIPACKAGES\fR...]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hive-apt
is an intelligent wrapper around apt that integrates with the Hive Stack to
provide AI-assisted package management. It automatically creates ZFS snapshots
before operations, provides installation guidance from the knowledge base, and
warns about potential issues.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install \fIPACKAGE\fR...
Install one or more packages. Creates a ZFS snapshot before installation.

.TP
.B remove \fIPACKAGE\fR...
Remove one or more packages. Creates a ZFS snapshot before removal.

.TP
.B update
Update package lists from repositories.

.TP
.B upgrade
Upgrade all installed packages to latest versions.

.TP
.B search \fIPATTERN\fR
Search for packages matching the pattern.

.TP
.B show \fIPACKAGE\fR
Display detailed information about a package.

.TP
.B info \fIPACKAGE\fR
Display package information from the Hive knowledge base.

.TP
.B autoremove
Remove automatically installed packages that are no longer needed.

.TP
.B clean
Clean the package cache.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Assume yes to all prompts.

.TP
.BR \-\-no-snapshot
Skip creating ZFS snapshot before operation.

.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Quiet mode, minimal output.

.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help message and exit.

.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Display version information and exit.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Install a package with AI guidance:
.B hive-apt install postgresql

.TP
Upgrade system with automatic snapshot:
.B hive-apt upgrade

.TP
Search for web servers:
.B hive-apt search nginx

.TP
Get Hive knowledge about a package:
.B hive-apt info docker

.SH KNOWLEDGE BASE
The Hive knowledge base provides:
.IP \(bu 2
Installation notes and post-install steps
.IP \(bu 2
Security warnings
.IP \(bu 2
Resource requirements
.IP \(bu 2
Common issues and solutions
.IP \(bu 2
Alternative packages

Knowledge files are stored in /var/lib/hive/knowledge/packages/.

.SH ZFS INTEGRATION
Before package operations that modify the system, hive-apt creates an automatic
ZFS snapshot with the naming convention:

.RS
hive-apt-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-{operation}
.RE

Use
.B hive-zfs list
to view snapshots and
.B hive-zfs rollback
to restore if needed.

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/hive/knowledge/packages/
Package knowledge YAML files.

.TP
.I /etc/hive/config.toml
Configuration including ZFS dataset settings.

